  "description": {
   "en": "'Do you believe in fate? '\nAfter being asked to guide the destiny of the 100th human being, a prospective 'god' who could become a real god meets Hana, who is bullied for being blind.\nIn order to ascend she sets her sights on helping Hana, who has a short time left to live, and in the process she realizes that the only mistake she made in the past is the reason why Hana lost her sight.\nAs time passes, Shin grows to truly love Hana and tries to put her past mistake in their proper place."
  },
